<title>FINLAND: Tampella says paid 430 markka for VAB. [corrected 13:00 gmt]</title>
<headline>Tampella says paid 430 markka for VAB. [corrected 13:00 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline from &quot;FIM 430 mln&quot; to &quot;430 markka&quot;.)</p>
<p>Tampella Oy said in a statement on Tuesday it paid 1,000 Austrian schillings or 430 markka (corrects from 430 million markka) for Voest-Alpine Bergtechnik (VAB) which it acquired from Austrian Osterreichische Industrieholding AG (OAIG) in July.</p>
<p>Tampella said it has taken responsibility of VAB's liabilities totalling 220 million markka.</p>
<p>&quot;Tampella has acquired the entire stock of VAB and has also taken responsibility for VAB's interest-bearing liabilities and commitments,&quot; Tampella said.</p>
</text>
